; ============================================================================
; Native package calls from the JS backend (libm pow).
;
; `bind = auto` decides how the #{c} extern below is bound, per target:
;   - node / bun / deno  -> koffi FFI: koffi.load(<compiler.link-libs entry>)
;                           (here "m" -> libm.so / libm.dylib / libm.dll)
;   - browser            -> WASM, and a `wasm = '<specifier>'` is REQUIRED
;                           (libm cannot be loaded as WASM, so add one for a
;                           real browser target, or use libc-style wrappers).
;
; The annotation may also be written on the `# import` line (own line above or
; trailing). Putting it on the extern keeps this example self-contained.
;
; Run it (Node, after `npm install` in this directory):
;   no run --js main.no          -> prints 1024
; ============================================================================
; 冪運算：外部宣告 C 標準 libm 的 pow(double, double)，呼叫由 koffi 轉接到 libm
; x f64: 底數（呼叫端傳 2.0）
; y f64: 指數（呼叫端傳 10.0）
; r f64: x 的 y 次方，本例為 2.0^10.0 = 1024

#{bind = auto, c}
pow = (x f64, y f64) (r f64)

; 入口由編譯器合成，直接寫頂層陳述（'main' 是保留名，不能再當函式名）
r = pow(2.0, 10.0)
print(r)
